{
  "id": "qRCHce9oQ-4",
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.18,
      "end": 7.93,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "- Our real estate agent wanted us to have a baby more than anyone else in our lives, more than anyone in our family.",
          "start": 0.18,
          "end": 5.9
        },
        {
          "text": "She hinted about it constantly.",
          "start": 5.9,
          "end": 7.93
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "real estate agent",
          "ko": "부동산 중개인",
          "type": "phrase"
        },
        {
          "term": "hinted about it constantly",
          "ko": "끊임없이 넌지시 비추다",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 7.93,
      "end": 23.47,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Every room she walked into, she'd be like, \"So this could be an office, \"or maybe a nursery.\"",
          "start": 7.93,
          "end": 18.81
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeah, ha ha, no, like we said, we don't know if we're gonna have-- \"No, no, I know, I know.",
          "start": 18.81,
          "end": 23.47
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "nursery",
          "ko": "아기방, 육아방",
          "type": "word"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 23.47,
      "end": 26.96,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"You don't know if you're gonna have them, but you know.",
          "start": 23.47,
          "end": 25.98
        },
        {
          "text": "\"You know, you never know.",
          "start": 25.98,
          "end": 26.96
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 26.96,
      "end": 34.54,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"Sometimes you don't know what's gonna happen and then, \"you know, something happens.\"",
          "start": 26.96,
          "end": 31.52
        },
        {
          "text": "Well yeah, that's how all of life works.",
          "start": 32.49,
          "end": 34.54
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 34.54,
      "end": 42.17,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"Okay, all right, okay, all right.\"",
          "start": 34.54,
          "end": 37.45
        },
        {
          "text": "\"This is an on-fire garbage can.\"",
          "start": 39.52,
          "end": 42.17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 47.2,
      "end": 56.78,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"Could be a nursery.\"",
          "start": 47.2,
          "end": 48.29
        },
        {
          "text": "She showed me a backyard once, she goes, \"I don't even like this backyard for you.\"",
          "start": 53.35,
          "end": 56.78
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 56.78,
      "end": 59.54,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I was like, oh do tell.",
          "start": 56.78,
          "end": 58.22
        },
        {
          "text": "She said, \"it's all pavement.",
          "start": 58.22,
          "end": 59.54
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "oh do tell",
          "ko": "어디 한번 말해 보세요 (반어적)",
          "type": "idiom"
        },
        {
          "term": "it's all pavement",
          "ko": "전부 콘크리트로 포장돼 있다",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 59.54,
      "end": 68.54,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"I think you should have some grass out there.",
          "start": 59.54,
          "end": 61.4
        },
        {
          "text": "\"You know, in case you have a couple little guys, \"running around in the grass.\"",
          "start": 61.4,
          "end": 68.54
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 68.54,
      "end": 75.91,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "And I got offended on behalf of my imaginary kids.",
          "start": 68.54,
          "end": 71.45
        },
        {
          "text": "I was like hey, lady, I went outside about as much as Powder, from the movie \"Powder\".",
          "start": 71.45,
          "end": 75.91
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "got offended on behalf of",
          "ko": "~을 대신해 기분이 상하다, 발끈하다",
          "type": "phrase"
        },
        {
          "term": "on behalf of",
          "ko": "~을 대신하여, 대표하여",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 75.91,
      "end": 85.93,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "My children are not gonna be playing out on grass, they will be up in their rooms playing violent video games and cat-fishing pedophiles.",
          "start": 75.91,
          "end": 82.84
        },
        {
          "text": "These are my children, and that's my wife!",
          "start": 82.84,
          "end": 85.93
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "cat-fishing",
          "ko": "(가짜 신분으로) 온라인에서 속이다",
          "type": "word"
        },
        {
          "term": "pedophiles",
          "ko": "소아성애자",
          "type": "word"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 89.93,
      "end": 94.46,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I didn't mean to make it sound like we don't want children.",
          "start": 89.93,
          "end": 91.96
        },
        {
          "text": "We don't, but I didn't mean to make it sound like that.",
          "start": 91.96,
          "end": 94.46
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "I didn't mean to make it sound like",
          "ko": "~처럼 들리게 할 의도는 아니었다",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 94.46,
      "end": 102.98,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "See, I just don't think babies like me very much.",
          "start": 94.46,
          "end": 97.68
        },
        {
          "text": "Sometimes babies will point at me and I don't care for that shit at all.",
          "start": 97.68,
          "end": 102.98
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 103.88,
      "end": 122.33,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Like, I'll be on an elevator and a baby will be there in its big stroller activity tray, just working on one Cheerio, with Bobby Fischer like intensity, like...",
          "start": 103.88,
          "end": 114.26
        },
        {
          "text": "And it'll look up at me and go.",
          "start": 120.54,
          "end": 122.33
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "stroller",
          "ko": "유모차",
          "type": "word"
        },
        {
          "term": "with Bobby Fischer like intensity",
          "ko": "(체스 천재처럼) 엄청난 집중력으로",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 124.83,
      "end": 137.8,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I like to lean in and go stop snitching, motherfucker and then walk off. (audience laughs) 'Cause you're never too young to learn our national no snitching policy.",
          "start": 124.83,
          "end": 132.72
        },
        {
          "text": "My friends have babies and I don't do so well with them.",
          "start": 134.6,
          "end": 137.8
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "stop snitching",
          "ko": "고자질·밀고 그만해",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 137.8,
      "end": 148.16,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I had a run in with a two year old girl, I know there are better ways to start that story, but...",
          "start": 137.8,
          "end": 143.63
        },
        {
          "text": "My friend Jeremy has this two year old girl, and I really like her.",
          "start": 145.32,
          "end": 148.16
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "had a run in with",
          "ko": "~와 (불쾌한) 충돌·시비가 있었다",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 148.16,
      "end": 164.25,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "She's a sweet kid, I really like his daughter a lot, but I was over at his family's house for the 4th of July and he had his daughter on his knee and it was a very lovely day, his whole extended family was there, and he was bouncing his two year old up and down and he pointed at me, and he said to his two year old, \"do you know who that is?",
          "start": 148.16,
          "end": 162.92
        },
        {
          "text": "\"That's your Uncle John.\"",
          "start": 162.92,
          "end": 164.25
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "extended family",
          "ko": "(친척까지 포함한) 대가족",
          "type": "phrase"
        },
        {
          "term": "bouncing his two year old up and down",
          "ko": "두 살배기를 무릎에 앉혀 위아래로 어르다",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 164.25,
      "end": 171.95,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "And I was like, oh my god, that's so sweet, I'm her Uncle John.",
          "start": 164.25,
          "end": 167.41
        },
        {
          "text": "And then they baby pointed at me and said, \"Uncle John has a penis.\"",
          "start": 167.41,
          "end": 171.95
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 174,
      "end": 184.42,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I thank you for laughing because no one did that day.",
          "start": 174,
          "end": 178.49
        },
        {
          "text": "Fell deadly silent is what they all did.",
          "start": 180.74,
          "end": 184.42
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "Fell deadly silent",
          "ko": "쥐 죽은 듯 조용해졌다",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 186.84,
      "end": 197.3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Hey, do you know what you're supposed to say when a baby points at you and knowingly says \"he has a penis\"?",
          "start": 186.84,
          "end": 193.49
        },
        {
          "text": "No, I'm asking 'cause I don't know what to say in that situation.",
          "start": 193.49,
          "end": 197.3
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "knowingly",
          "ko": "다 안다는 듯이, 의미심장하게",
          "type": "word"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 197.3,
      "end": 201.1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Here's what I went with that day.",
          "start": 197.3,
          "end": 198.81
        },
        {
          "text": "I said, oh, come on.",
          "start": 198.81,
          "end": 201.1
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "Here's what I went with",
          "ko": "내가 택한 건 이거였다",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 203.84,
      "end": 214.13,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I dunno, I thought that'd be good.",
          "start": 203.84,
          "end": 205.7
        },
        {
          "text": "But then it just made it worse 'cause it sounded like the baby and I had an arrangement not to talk about it and she had violated my trust.",
          "start": 207.27,
          "end": 214.13
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "an arrangement",
          "ko": "(사전) 합의, 약속",
          "type": "word"
        },
        {
          "term": "violated my trust",
          "ko": "내 신뢰를 저버렸다",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 214.13,
      "end": 222.87,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Like the baby had been like, \"do you have a penis?\"",
          "start": 214.13,
          "end": 216.44
        },
        {
          "text": "and I was like, yes I do, but you're a baby so discretion is key, and then the next day she goes, \"he has a penis\" and I go, oh come on!",
          "start": 216.44,
          "end": 222.87
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "discretion is key",
          "ko": "신중함(입조심)이 중요하다",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 222.87,
      "end": 228.42,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Someone can't keep a secret.",
          "start": 222.87,
          "end": 225.12
        },
        {
          "text": "Luckily Jeremy's wife saved the day.",
          "start": 226.46,
          "end": 228.42
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "can't keep a secret",
          "ko": "비밀을 못 지키다",
          "type": "phrase"
        },
        {
          "term": "saved the day",
          "ko": "위기를 모면하게 해 주다",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 228.42,
      "end": 237.66,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "The baby's mom saved the day.",
          "start": 228.42,
          "end": 229.96
        },
        {
          "text": "She came in, and she picked up the baby, and she was like, it's okay, she's just going through that phase where she says penis and vagina a lot.",
          "start": 229.96,
          "end": 237.66
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "going through that phase",
          "ko": "(일시적인) 그런 시기를 거치는 중",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 237.66,
      "end": 244.93,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Aren't we all?",
          "start": 237.66,
          "end": 239.01
        },
        {
          "text": "And by the way, it would have been a totally different situation if the baby had said vagina.",
          "start": 240.04,
          "end": 244.93
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 244.93,
      "end": 253.32,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Like, if a grown woman had walked in the room and the baby had been like, \"she has a vagina!\"",
          "start": 244.93,
          "end": 248.72
        },
        {
          "text": "the woman could be like, \"yes I do, and it's magnificent,\" and we would all be like, hooray!",
          "start": 248.72,
          "end": 253.32
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 254.26,
      "end": 260.47,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "You are brave!",
          "start": 254.26,
          "end": 256.27
        },
        {
          "text": "No one wants to applaud the penis of a 32 year old weirdo.",
          "start": 256.27,
          "end": 260.47
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "weirdo",
          "ko": "별난 사람, 이상한 놈",
          "type": "word"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
